insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('7924b689-e3bf-5ba6-97a5-fcf84a2d9845', 'wg5-narrative-writing-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Quiet on Silver Lake$q$, $q$(1) Last summer, my uncle Kwame took me canoeing on Silver Lake for the first time. (2) He sat in the back, and I sat in the front with a paddle that felt too big for my hands. (3) At first, we zigzagged across the water. (4) "Paddle on the same side as me," Uncle Kwame called.

(5) Soon, we glided past a patch of tall reeds. (6) Uncle Kwame suddenly lifted his paddle and pointed. (7) A tall gray heron was standing in the shallow water, as still as a statue. (8) Neither of us made a sound. (9) The heron lowered its long neck, and quick as a flash, it snatched a little fish. (10) Then it spread its huge wings and flapped away over the trees. (11) My favorite subject in school is math.

(12) We paddled back to the dock.$q$, 'draft')
