insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('4b8500d6-3c0e-5943-aba1-daf6d49d0bd6', 'wg5-opinion-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Shade Trees for the Playground$q$, $q$(1) Our playground has a climbing dome, four swings, and almost no shade. (2) The school should plant a row of shade trees along the edge of the playground. (3) On hot days, the metal slide gets so warm that students cannot use it. (4) Last June, our class measured the blacktop with a thermometer, and it was much hotter than the grass under our only tree. (5) Trees would give students a cool place to rest and talk.

(6) Shade trees would also help the environment. (7) Trees give homes to birds and squirrels. (8) Their roots hold soil in place when heavy rain falls. (9) My favorite playground game is freeze tag.

(10) Some people say trees take too long to grow. (11) ______ a nursery near our town sells young trees that are already taller than a teacher. (12) Planting them now means students will have shade for many years.$q$, 'draft')
