(8) Last spring, a wheelchair basketball team visited our school. (9) The players let us try their chairs during gym class. (10) I learned that turning and dribbling at the same time takes a lot of practice. (11) Our gym floor had been waxed the week before. (12) Most of all, the visit showed me how much skill and strength the sport takes.$q$, 'draft')
