values ('11c10f2d-b9f9-5617-9590-e488b3b09c62', 'wg5-paragraph-transitions-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-paragraph-transitions'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Our Class Book Swap$q$, $q$(1) Last month, our fifth-grade class held a book swap. (2) Many of us had shelves full of books we had already read. (3) ____, we wanted new stories without spending any money. (4) Our teacher, Ms. Okafor, suggested that everyone bring two books to trade. (5) For each book a student brought, that student received a ticket. (6) Each ticket could be traded for one book from the swap table.

(7) The swap was a bigger success than we expected. (8) Students brought more than eighty books in all. (9) ____, the second-grade classes heard about it and asked to join next time. (10) We gave the leftover books to the town library, especially the picture books, which the children's room needed most. (11) ____$q$, 'draft')
