        '3-5', $q$Draft: Messages on Wings$q$, $q$(1) In "Wings That Carried the News," Tomas Ferreira describes how people once used pigeons to send messages. (2) Ferreira shows that pigeons were useful messengers because they could always find their way home. (3) He explains that a pigeon was carried far from its home and then let go with a tiny note tied to its leg. (4) The bird would fly straight back home, sometimes from more than a hundred miles away. (5) ____.

(6) Ferreira also points out that pigeons were fast. (7) He writes that a pigeon could fly about fifty miles in one hour. (8) In those days, a rider on horseback might need a whole day to travel the same distance. (9) This comparison shows ____.

(10) Pigeons were not perfect messengers, however. (11) Ferreira notes that a pigeon could only fly to one place, its home. (12) Still, the evidence in the article shows that pigeons solved a real problem for people who needed news to travel quickly.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
