   $q$The writer wants to add a sentence after sentence 11 that gives more evidence about the limit of pigeons. Which sentence fits best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ferreira says pigeons can see some colors that people cannot see.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-fact"},{"text":"I think pigeons are smarter than most other kinds of birds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-analysis"},{"text":"Ferreira explains that people had to carry the birds away by wagon or ship before each message could be sent.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ferreira explains that pigeons could still fly home through rain and strong wind.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"supports-wrong-point"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Ferreira explains that people had to carry the birds away by wagon or ship before each message could be sent.$q$, $q$The limit is that pigeons only fly home, so people first had to haul them away, which the correct choice explains. Flying through rain and wind shows a strength of pigeons, so it does not fit a paragraph about a limit.$q$, 'draft', 'adca18d1-30a3-5716-a37f-abef026e5f86')
