   $q$Which sentence would best fill blank (13) as the conclusion?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Kowalczyk writes that the pass must happen inside a zone marked on the track.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"evidence-without-analysis"},{"text":"Relay races are exciting, and I hope to run in one someday.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-analysis"},{"text":"Kowalczyk proves that speed does not matter at all in a relay race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"Kowalczyk's article shows that a relay can be won in the passing zone, because smooth handoffs save time.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Kowalczyk's article shows that a relay can be won in the passing zone, because smooth handoffs save time.$q$, $q$The correct conclusion restates the claim and the reason from the evidence. The choice saying speed does not matter at all goes too far, because sentence 12 says teamwork matters as much as speed, not instead of it.$q$, 'draft', '2a272bdc-2330-5f95-bb1a-7648febe0f1d')
