        '3-5', $q$Draft: What a Weather Journal Shows$q$, $q$(1) In "Keeping a Weather Journal," Priya Raman explains how writing down the weather each day can help people notice patterns. (2) Raman shows that a weather journal turns everyday observations into useful information. (3) She suggests writing down the temperature, the type of clouds, and the wind at the same time every day. (4) ____, she explains, the notes are easy to compare from one day to the next.

